From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Report GOOD for native DVD cancel-all operation completion
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4
Classification: native DVD API operation-result contract.

Original Wii DVDCancelAllAsync completes the cancellation operation with GOOD0.
Canceled command callbacks separately report CANCELED-3. Preserve existing
worker/queue/reset/drain and callback argument behavior; the active command
argument mismatch remains a separate ownership prerequisite.

--- a/lib/dolphin/dvd/dvd.cpp
+++ b/lib/dolphin/dvd/dvd.cpp
@@ -1100,7 +1100,7 @@
 int DVDCancelAllAsync(DVDCBCallback callback) {
   s_worker.cancel_all();
   if (callback != nullptr) {
-    callback(DVD_RESULT_CANCELED, nullptr);
+    callback(DVD_RESULT_GOOD, nullptr);
   }
   return TRUE;
 }
